ind a massive slab of broken concrete pinning her down."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As her senses return, the fierce heat from the bombardment washes over her, tormenting her whole body."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She can't move at all. When she tries to push the slab away, her frame does not even have the strength to lift what should have been a trivial weight."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Crunch..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Crunch..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hearing footsteps approaching, Tokarev immediately stops moving."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then she feels someone pushing the slab off her. She tightens her grip on her gun—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-RuinedCity","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.3","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_lifttable","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rumble...!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The instant the concrete is shoved asid